WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.720
Takuya...

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.820
Takuya...

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.130
Don't worry.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.540
Takuya...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.430
I'm here with you.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.840
Help her...

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.710
The one you love...

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.270
Mother?

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:24.700
"Episode 11: That Kiss, Once More"

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.490
Arima-<i>kun</i>?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.980
What's wrong?

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.680
I had a dream.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.840
A dream about my mother.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.430
About Ayumi-<i>san</i>?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.450
No. The one who gave birth to me.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.560
I guess I'm in worse shape than I thought.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.610
In my dream, she was standing over there.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.120
Wait here, Mio.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.240
Wait!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.110
What?

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.580
There's something on
the other side of the waterfall...

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.350
Well?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.970
There's something back there.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:29.600
I'll grab it.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.750
Be careful!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.030
You okay?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:41.990
Yeah.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.120
It's beautiful...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.210
It's a jewel.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.120
Was my mom telling me it was here?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.040
What kind of jewel?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.020
It's a very important jewel...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.810
It was in my dad's last message to me.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.220
A very important jewel...

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:07.100
Oh, if you're interested in my family jewels,
I'll be happy to show them to you.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.640
Even at a time like this...

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.390
You really are the worst!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.060
Aww, a compliment! I'm blushing!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.600
It wasn't a compliment!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.730
So, what's this jewel for?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.400
Well, basically...

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.740
It's a reproductive organ that creates
the semen you need to make babies--

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.060
Not those jewels!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.750
Yeah... I've come this far.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.370
I should tell you the truth.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.310
About what?

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.840
You saw Dr. Imagawa's body 
on the way in, right?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.090
And you read her journal, right?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.300
Of course.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.570
The Reflector Device she wrote about...

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:52.980
...is this.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.490
Why do you have it?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.660
My dad left it to me.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:03.940
You can use it to go to
a different parallel world.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.370
You can set a certain time and place,
and go back to it.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.410
That's unbelievable...

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.340
I redid my trip here several times, actually.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:19.440
I'd love to show it to you, but I'm
the only one who can travel when I use it.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.220
What time and place is it set to now?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.170
The entrance to Mt. Sankaku.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.080
Just before we came inside to look for you.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.490
So if you had to redo it again...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.400
The time I spent with you...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.150
The kiss you gave me...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.400
They'll never have happened, will they?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.410
Don't worry.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.140
That's not going to happen.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.460
We'll get out of here safely.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.620
Look.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.940
The cave continues on
the other side of the waterfall.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.130
It may lead to an exit.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.610
Mom must've wanted me to see this.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.380
Let's go.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.020
Boss!

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.520
What do I do? It's morning...

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.780
The construction's going to start,
and they'll find us...

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.280
They might call the police!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.240
What are you doing here?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.700
The poli...!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.660
...ce?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.550
Hatano-<i>san</i>?

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.270
I told you so many times
to stay away from Mt. Sankaku.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:41.610
Well, um...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.050
Did someone go inside?

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.550
It looks like Shimazu-<i>san \</i>Nwent inside yesterday.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.300
And Mitsuki-<i>san</i> and
the boss went in to find her.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:01.300
If they reach that location
inside Mt. Sankaku...

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.230
That location?

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.240
...they'll be in grave danger.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.230
Hatano-<i>san</i>?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.870
What's this sound?

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.830
It's coming from deeper in.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.750
What is this place?

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.440
It's a mess, but it looks
like it was once really fancy.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.390
An 8,000-year-old palace...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.600
I don't think I'd pay a 
lot of money to move in.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.680
What is it?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.120
The hero's sword, I guess.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.830
Arima-<i>kun</i>, are you sure that's a good idea?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.600
I may be able to become the legendary hero!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.010
You got an item!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.880
It's rusty, but it may come in handy.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.550
I hope we're never in
a situation where it does.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.680
Better safe than sorry.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.770
You find something to take, too.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.520
I don't think there's any recovery potions...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.990
My dick never needs
recovery potions, you know.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.610
Give it a rest.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.950
That sound again...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.280
It's like the sound of a machine...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:49.740
Arima-<i>kun</i>...

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.670
The only path leads towards the sound.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.560
Let's go.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.360
How do we open this?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.430
I'll do it.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.800
Now we can get through.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.850
What is this?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:41.070
What's a machine like
this doing in a mountain?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.880
It's got to be at least 
a hundred meters tall...

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.230
Nothing that size could exist down here...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.810
There's only one place it could.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.990
Don't tell me...

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.040
Hurry! Get that stuff out of here!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.790
W-Wait, Hatano-<i>san</i>!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.240
If the device activates, more will die.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.960
What device?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.420
If the two of them are below the device,

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.080
it won't only be the
construction workers that die.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.220
If you want to save them, then hurry!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.060
I don't understand!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.140
Explain!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:38.670
Was this what Dr. Imagawa
was looking for under Mt. Sankaku?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:44.080
So this thing was made 8,000 years ago?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.030
Why?

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.710
Takuya.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.130
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.190
Shimazu-<i>san</i>, too.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.150
Neither of you move.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.220
I think you've probably 
figured this out by now,

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.890
but this tower is a lightning generator.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.000
I see...

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.440
If it's active,

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.030
that means that it's morning, and
Geotech has started their hauling operations.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.190
Correct.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.700
You're so very smart, Takuya.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.120
When you try to remove
the psychite from this area,

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.540
the device activates and creates lightning.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:33.770
Light blazes from the tower,
scorching the people with hellfire...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.900
That's what the tapestry was talking about!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:45.640
Did you know about this 
device the whole time?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:49.020
We were already aware
of the device's existence.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.990
But we didn't know how to get in.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:56.270
So what you did was
very, very helpful, Shimazu-<i>san</i>.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:01.780
Now hand over the Reflector Device!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.300
Mitsuki-<i>san</i> isn't her normal self right now.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.580
Ryuzoji's power has her hypnotized.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:12.540
With Professor Imagawa 
and Dr. Arima both gone,

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:16.000
the Legacy hypothesis
belongs to Ryuzoji-<i>sensei</i>!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.840
And so does the Reflector Device!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.800
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>, wake up!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:25.030
This isn't what you really want!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:27.960
I...

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.810
T-Takuya...

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.290
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.740
Everything I do... is for Ryuzoji-<i>sensei</i>!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.580
Hiding won't save you.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.020
Now come out.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.690
Holy shit!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.930
What are you doing? Get back to work!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.640
Stop working!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.560
Stop, please!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.940
This place is off-limits, you know.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.640
There's going to be another lightning strike!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.520
It's gonna happen!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.350
Don't be ridiculous.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.360
Hey, get to work.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:24.030
When you're done,
there'll be a big bonus waiting for you.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.410
Don't do this!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.830
--You need to stay out of this, little girl.
--Don't!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.300
H-Help me!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.140
I-It's not my fault!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.350
Chief Arima is in charge here, not me!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.310
Please! Help me!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:00.840
I'm coming!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.480
It's dangerous!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.780
Don't worry!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:07.990
I won't die until
I've apologized to Shimazu-<i>san</i>!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.870
Now stop hiding and come out.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.660
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>, watch out!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.390
Get down, damn it!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.160
Move! It's dangerous to stand there!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.660
Takuya...?

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:12.670
I can't disobey Ryuzoji-<i>sensei</i>
no matter what I do.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:15.850
Takuya...

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.690
Protect Shimazu-<i>san</i>.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.430
Shimazu-<i>san</i>,

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.730
take care

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.440
of Takuya.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.750
Mitsuki-<i>san</i>!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:54.600
The Reflector Device fell under here!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.000
Mio!

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:00.850
Give up on it!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.350
Or we'll die too!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:07.190
You can do this again if you
have the Reflector Device, right?

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:11.320
You can redo this and save Ichijo-<i>sensei</i>!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.540
Mio...

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.990
We have to save her.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.700
She can't just die like that,
as somebody's slave!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.170
Now!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.350
I got it! Use it, now!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.930
I'll redo this after we escape.

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:47.520
If I go back, alone,
what happens to you in this world?

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.030
Please...

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:55.080
Escape on your own, with 
the Reflector Device.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.660
Do this over!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:05.290
Just promise next time, you'll find me...

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.690
And then...

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.130
Next time, give me a proper kiss!

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:23.980
No!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.080
First we both get out of here alive!

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.010
There'll still be time to go back then.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.690
But...

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:31.570
Leave it to me!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.580
Take this!

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:54.550
Now! We're leaving!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.740
Right!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.360
It's collapsing!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.280
Hurry!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.660
Boss... Shimazu-<i>san</i>...

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.710
I'm borrowing this.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.670
W-Where are you going?

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.130
Wait!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.430
There's the exit! We can get out!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.440
Is this a well?

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.020
No way we can climb up that wall...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.070
Boss!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:58.990
Yuki?

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.930
We'll drop you a rope.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.270
Hatano-<i>san</i>, too?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.920
Is this... Ryuzoji's mansion?

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.130
Boss!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.920
We're trespassing!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.720
We can't let him find us.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:23.720
How did you know where we were?

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.270
Hatano-<i>san</i> said you'd be here.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.100
You knew about the underground passage.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.560
Someone told me.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.270
"Someone"?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.400
Anyway, Shimazu-<i>san</i>...

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:42.560
I... um... I have to apologize to you.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.450
I'm the one who put that
stuff up on the bulletin board.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:53.760
I was jealous of how you
and the boss were getting close...

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.640
I'm... I'm really sorry!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.170
I'm so glad you're both safe...

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.550
I'm so glad...

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.930
It's fine, Yuki.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.490
Stop crying.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.520
That solves everything here.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.410
Boss?

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.530
What's that?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.830
The correction of chaos again...

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.990
It seems this wasn't where you belonged.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:35.660
Yeah.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.130
Sorry, Mio.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.220
It looks like I won't be able
to use the Reflector Device.

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:43.340
Then what about Ichijo-<i>sensei</i>?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.420
Don't worry.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.060
I'll meet Ryuzoji and work things out.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.390
In a different time,
and different place,

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.600
than this one...

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.290
Don't make a big deal when I disappear, okay?

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:58.960
Bye.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.950
I see.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.830
So you saw the device under Mt. Sankaku?

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.020
Dad...

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.580
What the hell was that thing?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.380
And what the hell that bastard Ryuzoji after?

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.170
As always, you do nothing but ask questions.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.350
Use your own brain for once.

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:36.230
Not that your ant-sized brain
is capable of thought.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:42.530
I would've preferred
to tell you about Ryuzoji in writing,

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:48.240
but at the time, I didn't know
that he was actually something else.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.910
"Something else"?

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:54.370
Yes. Something else, beyond our ken.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:57.750
As for what that is,
even if I don't tell you know,

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.400
you'll learn very soon.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Episode 12: The Secret Under the White Coat"

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:41.040
Episode 12: "The Secret 
Under the White Coat."
